{"id":"t93gs8xi8vx4ekpnps93bixmw","title":"注意自然背景音如何揭示动物秘密","originalTitle":"'I heard a barnacle'—how paying attention to nature's background noise can reveal animal secrets","summary":"在华盛顿的奥林匹克半岛，作者注意到低潮时一只打开的贻贝发出的咔嗒声，从而意识到普通的声音也可以揭示动物的行为。通过观察蜜蜂和其他动物，作者强调了观察自然时保持好奇心和细致聆听的重要性，这可以揭示出新的发现。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Phys.org"},"links":{"original":"https://phys.org/news/2026-11-heard-barnacle-paying-attention-nature.html"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-06T18:00:01.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-07T12:11:51.271Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-07T12:11:51.271Z","category":"neuroscience","tags":["研究成果"],"score":27,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"b8fa6618-d4d5-4be4-94a4-73a78b9bfa2d","title":"通过自然声音观察揭示动物行为新方法"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"b8fa6618-d4d5-4be4-94a4-73a78b9bfa2d","title":"通过自然声音观察揭示动物行为新方法"}],"topics":[],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fWRH6sTWNAjk","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}